Subject: [PATCH] fix(worlds/bilibili): preserve audience interaction
 identities

Decode V2 protobuf entry, follow and share signals in the World. Preserve named entry events for Persona decisions while retaining entry aggregates. Malformed packets cannot invent arrivals. Verified with 5055 passing tests and TypeScript checks; actual captured V2 frame retains sender identity.
